# Integration of the NRL Digital Library.

**Authors:** King, James

## Abstract
The Naval Research Laboratory (NRL) Library has identified six primary areas that need improvement: infrastructure, InfoWeb, TORPEDO Ultra, journal data management, classified data, and linking software. It is rebuilding InfoWeb and TORPEDO Ultra as database-driven Web applications, upgrading the STILAS library catalog, and creating other support databases that will help bring all the information sources into a unified Digital Library. (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ637587

